{{- /*
The short text for the chat targets (ntfy, Telegram, Slack, Teams): one line
per problem, grouped like the mail, and the link to the web UI. The subject is
not part of it, because most targets show it separately. Spaces and blank
lines at the start and the end are removed after rendering.

If the text is too long for the service, it is rendered again with fewer
problems, and .Omitted says how many were left out.
*/ -}}
{{- define "severity"}}{{if eq .Severity "critical"}}CRITICAL{{else}}WARNING{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- define "time"}}{{if not .IsZero}}{{.Format "2006-01-02 15:04 UTC"}}{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- define "affected"}}{{if .Affected}}, {{len .Affected}} affected{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- if .NodesDown}}Node down:
{{range .NodesDown}}- {{.Object}} (since {{template "time" .Since}}){{template "affected" .}}
{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- if .New}}New:
{{range .New}}- {{template "severity" .}} {{.Object}}: {{.Reason}} (since {{template "time" .Since}})
{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- if .Reminders}}Still critical:
{{range .Reminders}}- {{.Object}}: {{.Reason}} (since {{template "time" .Since}}){{template "affected" .}}
{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- if .Resolved}}Resolved:
{{range .Resolved}}- {{.Object}}: {{.Reason}} (since {{template "time" .Since}}, resolved {{template "time" .ResolvedAt}})
{{end}}{{end -}}
{{- if .Omitted}}… and {{.Omitted}} more, see {{if .BaseURL}}{{.BaseURL}}{{else}}the web UI{{end}}
{{- else if .BaseURL}}
{{.BaseURL}}
{{- end}}
